# @mail between two players in different rooms. Runs last: the mail it sends stays in the mailboxes.
::case mail.fwd-by-name  @mail/fwd matches recipients by player name, not by what is nearby
::login alice Alice alicepass
::login bob Bob bobpass
::as bob
home
::as alice
@mail Alice=Forward me/A note to pass on.
@mail/fwd 1=Bob
@mail/fwd 1=Nobody
@mail/fwd 1=Bob Alice
::as bob
@tel me=[loc(*Alice)]
::as alice

::case mail.fwd-refused  a forward the recipient's mail lock refuses is silent and still counted
::as bob
@lock/mail me=!*Alice
::as alice
@mail/fwd 1=*Bob
::as bob
@unlock/mail me
